meta {
  name: Slotty API
}

auth {
  mode: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  Slotty NestJS API collection.

  Global prefix: `/api`
  Auth: Bearer JWT (`Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}`)

  1. Local: run Auth → Dev Login (no Google/Apple token). Tokens are saved automatically.
  2. Or set `idToken` and run Auth → Google Login / Apple Login.
  3. Use Users, Profile, Integrations, Customers, Events, Messages, Broadcasts, and Packages folders.
}
